note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note The k-part sum of one tile row (or, without block scales, of adjacent rows packed as one) of the general GEMM
note (CUDApp#144, src/omega_gpu_gemm_ex.c l.421-423):
note acc[j] += (f64 P[j]) * f, f = (f64 sa) * (f64 sb[kb][(n0 + j) / bn]) under block scales; without them f is 1.0
note and the product is (f64 P[j]) itself (x * 1.0 = x exactly, a NaN x already quiet from the widening), so it is skipped.
note q: 0 nc (<= 4096), 1 block scales, 2 n0, 3 bn; s holds binary32 bits: s[0] the row's sa, s[1 + c] the sb of
note column block n0 / bn + c (the C shell copies that window). pv: the nc P bits of the row.
note The factor is found once per column block, not per element: r counts the columns of the block so far.

note the block factor of column j: sa times the sb of column block (n0 + j) / bn
fn gx_bf q view ulong 8 s view uchar 65536 j ulong to f64
ix = div add get q 2 j get q 3
ix = sub ix div get q 2 get q 3
f = f64 bitcast f32 gx_get view s add ix 1 4
z = ulong 0
ret mul f64 bitcast f32 gx_get view s z 4 f
end

fn gemm_ex_acc q view ulong 8 pv view uchar 65536 s view uchar 65536 acc edit ulong 4096 to ulong
if eq get q 1 0
for j ulong get q 0
put acc j bitcast ulong add bitcast f64 get acc j f64 bitcast f32 gx_get view pv j 4
end
ret get q 0
end
r = rem get q 2 get q 3
f = gx_bf view q view s ulong 0
for j ulong get q 0
x = mul f64 bitcast f32 gx_get view pv j 4 f
put acc j bitcast ulong add bitcast f64 get acc j x
r = add r 1
if eq r get q 3
r = ulong 0
f = gx_bf view q view s add j 1
end
end
ret get q 0
end
